{"id":"word:hebrew:H5982","type":"word","title":"עַמּוּד","subtitle":"H5982 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a column (as standing ); also a stand , i.e. platform","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to עַמּוּד (H5982) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 112 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"עַמּוּד (ʻammûwd) means a column (as standing ); also a stand , i.e. platform First listed occurrence: 1Chr 18 8."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"עַמּוּד","transliteration":"ʻammûwd","pronunciation":"am-mood'","strong":"H5982","lemmaId":"hebrew:H5982","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["עַמּוּדֵ֣י","הָ/עַמּוּדִֽים","הָ/עַמּ֣וּד","עַמֻּדֵי/הֶ֣ם","עַמּ֣וּד"],"morphs":[["HTd/Ncmpa",32],["HNcmpc",11],["HNcmpc/Sp3mp",9],["HTd/Ncmsa",8],["HNcmsc",8],["HR/Ncmsc",6],["HC/Ncmpc/Sp3ms",5],["HNcmpc/Sp3ms",5],["HC/R/Ncmsc",5],["HNcmpa",4]]},"definitions":{"short":"a column (as standing ); also a stand , i.e. platform","usage":"× apiece, pillar.","full":"H5982. ammud עַמֻּד עַמּוּד, 110 noun masculine 1Kin 7:15 pillar, column ; — עַמּוּד absolute 7:15 +, construct Exod 13:21 +; עַמֻּד absolute Jer 52:21 , construct Num 14:14 ; suffix עַמּוּדוֺ 2Chr 23:13 ; plural עַמּוּדִים 1Kin 7:16 +, less often ׳עַמֻּ 7:21 +; construct עַמּוּדֵי Exod 26:32 +, less often ׳עַמֻּ 38:17 +; suffix עַמּוּדָיו 36:38 +, עַמֻּדָיו 27:10 +, etc.; — 1 pillar , supporting house Judg 16:25-26 , 29 ; pillars in tabernacle Exod 27:10-11 , 17 ; 36:38 ; Num 3:37 27 t. Exodus, Numbers (P), + שִׁטִּים עַמּוּדֵי pillars of acacia wood Exod 26:32 , 37 ; 36:36 ; pillars in Solomon's palace 1Kin 7:2-3 , 6 , הָע ׳אוּלָם 7:6 , אֲרָזִים עַמּוּדֵי 7:2 pillars of cedar (P); in Ezekiel's temple Ezek 42:6 (twice in verse); ׳ע שֵׁשׁ Est 1:6 (in palace), Song 5:15 (simile). 2 two bronze pillars — 1Kin 7:15 ; 2Kin 25:13 = Jer 52:17 — before temple 1Kin 7:15 (twice in verse) + 14 t. 1 Kings 7, + 2Kin 25:16-17 , (twice in verse) = Jer 52:20-21 , (twice in verse), 27:19 ; 1Chr 18:8 ; 2Chr 3:15 , 17 5 t. Chronicles; perhaps one of these was ׳הָע by which king stood in temple 2Kin 11:14 2Chr 23:13 ; 2Kin 23:3 ; &gt; ׳ע here = standing-place, platform Thes and others; two pillars before Ezekiel's temple Ezek 40:49 . 3 columns, uprights , of silver Song 3:10 (litter). 4 ׳ע עָשָׁן Judg 20:40 column of smoke: ׳ע (הֶ)עָנָן Exod 13:21-22 , (J) + 6 t. J E, hence Neh 9:12 , 19 ; Psa 99:7 ; || ׳ע (הָ)אֵשׁ Exod 13:21-22 , (J), Num 14:14 (JE), Neh 9:12 , 19 ; ׳ע וְעָנָן קֵשׁ Exod 14:24 (J), all of the theophanies at time of Exodus. 5. a. ׳ע בּרזֶל Jer 1:18 (figurative of prophet). b. poetic of pillars of earth Job 9:5 + Job 75:4, of heaven 26:11 . c. of wisdom's house Prov 9:1 .","rootNote":"or עַמֻּד ; from 5975 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 18 8","keyReferences":["1Chr 18 8","1Kgs 7 2","1Kgs 7 2","1Kgs 7 3","1Kgs 7 6","1Kgs 7 6","1Kgs 7 15","1Kgs 7 15"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":112,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 18 8","book":"1Chr","chapter":18,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָֽ/עַמּוּדִ֔ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 7 2","book":"1Kgs","chapter":7,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עַמּוּדֵ֣י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 7 2","book":"1Kgs","chapter":7,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָ/עַמּוּדִֽים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 7 3","book":"1Kgs","chapter":7,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָֽ/עַמּוּדִ֔ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 7 6","book":"1Kgs","chapter":7,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָֽ/עַמּוּדִים֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 7 6","book":"1Kgs","chapter":7,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/עַמֻּדִ֥ים","source":"hebrew","mor